    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/asserts> <https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1-norm>.
<https://ns.webcivics.net/concept/therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gf-ss-1-norm> a <https://ns.webcivics.net/values/Obligation>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
