    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits supplying a medical device without proper authority.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the person has been granted an authority under subsection 41HC(1) relating to a specified kind of medical device; and (b) the person supplies a medical device of that kind: ...";
