    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) there may be on any premises a particular thing in respect of which this Act or the regulations have not been complied (b) it is necessary in the interests of public health to exercise powers under this section in order to avoid an imminent risk of death, serious illness or serious injury;";
